# Reuses the same Google Maps Platform key as the phlask-map repo (see its
# .env / VITE_REACT_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY). Must be VITE_-prefixed so Vite
# inlines it into the client bundle — it's used client-side only, to render
# the map + Street View panel on the /reviews/:id detail page. Ask in
# #phlask-data if you need the value.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
